h)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "theory/15-Bet-vs-Missed/01-Guideline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No ultraconectado high apostar tudo desprotege o range de check."}, {"id": "theory_15_bet_vs_missed_01_guideline_draws_buckets_meio", "label": "Regra 5 \u2014 Os draws ficam nos buckets do meio", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "theory/15-Bet-vs-Missed/01-Guideline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "theory_15_bet_vs_missed_01_guideline_underpair_ataca", "label": "Regra 6 \u2014 Underpair s\u00f3 aposta quando ataca m\u00e3os melhores (2-2 a 4-4 sim, 7-7 a 9-9 0%)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "theory/15-Bet-vs-Missed/01-Guideline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "theory_15_bet_vs_missed_01_guideline_sizes_b25_b50", "label": "Regra 7 \u2014 Use s\u00f3 B25 e B50", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "theory/15-Bet-vs-Missed/01-Guideline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Extraem valor, reduzem o SPR e deixam o range de call previs\u00edvel; B70 \u00e9 imprevis\u00edvel."}, {"id": "theory_15_bet_vs_missed_01_guideline_size_acompanha_grupo", "label": "Regra 8 \u2014 O size acompanha o grupo de m\u00e3os, e n\u00e3o a sua m\u00e3o", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "theory/15-Bet-vs-Missed/01-Guideline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "theory_15_bet_vs_missed_01_guideline_size_unico_por_board", "label": "Regra 9 \u2014 Um size \u00fanico por board, a frequ\u00eancia \u00e9 que muda", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "theory/15-Bet-vs-Missed/01-Guideline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captu